# Deepfake Research RAG

A retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) system that answers questions over a 
corpus of audio deepfake detection research papers, using local, free tools 
end-to-end (no API costs).

## Architecture
PDF corpus → chunk (500 chars, 50 overlap) → embed (all-MiniLM-L6-v2) 
→ store (ChromaDB) → [query time] → retrieve top-k → prompt → 
generate (Llama 3.2 3B via Ollama) → answer + citations

